The S+Resample library (see below) simplifies this.  You can do either:
        bootstrap2( x, colMeans, data2 = y )
        bootstrap2( data, colMeans, treatment = myGroupingVector )
The use of colMeans rather than mean allows for multiple variables.

There are also functions for two-sample permutation tests:
        permutationTest2 (general)
        permutationTestMeans (specifically for means)

