Or better yet:

rowVars <- function(x, ...) {
 n <- NCOL(x)
 (rowSums(x^2, ...) - n * rowMeans(x, ...)^2)/(n - 1)
}

x <- matrix(rnorm(100000), 10000, 10)
system.time(y1 <- apply(x, 1, var))   # 0.95
system.time(y2 <- rowVars(x))         # 0.03
sum((y1 - y2)^2)                      # 2.655251e-28

Of course, for most people either one is fast enough.

BTW, you should post R questions to r-help and not s-news.

HTH,
--sundar

